{"ts":1793393240645,"event":"done","summary":"validateApp now throws unless the app declares a non-empty owner. Released @mfe/shared-contracts 2.0.0 (breaking, so major). Apps updated to pass their package.json team and depend on ^2.0.0: core-shell (platform), sub-route-billing (payments), sub-route-reports (insights). Assumptions: owner is hardcoded in each app's source to match package.json team (the bundlers cannot read package.json); 'empty' means missing, non-string, or whitespace-only. Contract was published before the app PRs since they need 2.0.0 from the registry. PRs #1-#4 merged, CI and CD green."}
